    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the battlefield of the future! WarLink - VR thrusts you into the heart of futuristic warfare, where you'll experience adrenaline-pumping action and strategic battles like never before.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/7d6e693367163a05da1ef52d234f2efe.poster.avif?t=1708671901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/7d6e693367163a05da1ef52d234f2efe.webm?t=1708671901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/7d6e693367163a05da1ef52d234f2efe.mp4?t=1708671901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Battle Royale Mode: Engage in thrilling battles where survival is the only way to victory. Parachute into the battlefield, scavenge for weapons and gear and outlast your opponents in an ever-shrinking play area. With intense firefights and strategic gameplay, every match is a test of skill and endurance.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/08f39c72c4162ba5888b432f317826d2.poster.avif?t=1708671901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/08f39c72c4162ba5888b432f317826d2.webm?t=1708671901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/08f39c72c4162ba5888b432f317826d2.mp4?t=1708671901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Battle with Robots Mode: Face off against advanced robotic enemies in a challenging mode that will push your combat skills to the limit. Fight through waves of enemies, each more formidable than the last, using a variety of tactics and weapons to emerge victorious.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/ca7b35266cdb0fb8c92c4bf1a87651ae.poster.avif?t=1708671901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/ca7b35266cdb0fb8c92c4bf1a87651ae.webm?t=1708671901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1489490/extras/ca7b35266cdb0fb8c92c4bf1a87651ae.mp4?t=1708671901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wide Selection of Characters: Choose from a diverse roster of characters, each with their own unique abilities and personalities. Whether you prefer to be a stealthy assassin, a heavy-hitting tank, or a versatile support, there's a character to suit every playstyle.<br><br>Plenty of Weapons: Arm yourself with an impressive array of futuristic weapons, from high-powered rifles and explosive launchers to energy weapons and melee weapons. With so many options at your disposal, you can customize your loadout to suit your preferred playstyle and strategy.<br><br>Futuristic Backgrounds: Immerse yourself in stunning, futuristic environments that will transport you to a world ravaged by war. From urban cityscapes to desolate wastelands, each environment is beautifully crafted and rich in detail, thanks to HDR support.<br><br>Parachute Jumping: Take your battles to new heights with the ability to parachute into the battlefield. Use this strategic advantage to surprise your enemies, access hard-to-reach areas, and plan your approach to each match with precision.<br><br>Regular Updates and New Content: With regular updates and new content, WarLink - VR is constantly evolving, offering new challenges and experiences to keep you engaged. From new characters and weapons to fresh game modes and maps, there's always something new to discover.<br><br>Are you ready to step into the future of warfare? Join the battle in WarLink - VR and experience the thrill of futuristic combat like never before!",
